@opencharacter/packs: every official Open Character Format pack
================================================================================

This package re-exports the official packs, each its own package with its own
license, and copies each pack's English text into dist/i18n. Every pack and its
text keep their own license; each pack's package holds its LICENSE file. The
package's own code (the generated index files that import the packs) is under
the Apache License 2.0, like the rest of the project's code
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

Whoever passes on a pack's content must pass on that pack's credit and notices,
which follow, pack by pack, verbatim.

